;parsee shits her bed.
;she didn't wear diapers to bed because she was only experiencing it during the day.
;she wants you to clean it up.
@M_KOJO_IRAI_UNIQUE_102_K60(ROLE, SCENE, CLIENT_ID)
#DIMS ROLE     ;キャラの立場、依頼者かそうでないか
#DIMS SCENE    ;セリフの表示されるタイミング
#DIM  CLIENT_ID;依頼者IDだけ抜き出したもの
;--------------------------------------------------
;RETURN 0 の部分は共通の口上が表示されます
;依頼ごとの口上を表示する部分は RETURN 0 を RETURN 1 にしてください
;--------------------------------------------------
SELECTCASE SCENE
CASE "依頼提示時"
	B = (CFLAG:60:3100 / 10)
	PRINTFORMDW %CALLNAME:60% looks at you, %HIS_HER(60)% back turned against a wall.
	PRINTFORML 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%... I....」
	PRINTFORMDL %HIS_HER(60,1)% voice cracks, trying to find words.
	PRINTFORML 「I pooped my bed.」
	PRINTFORML 「It stinks so bad. I need you to help clean it up.」
	PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(60,1)% looks down, mortified.
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORML 「I was sleeping last night, and suddenly I woke up taking in a huge foul odor and an uncomfortable wetness all over my back.」
	IF B == 2
		PRINTFORML 「I'm sorry. I didn't go to the toilet before bed.」
		PRINTFORML 「I didn't feel the need to go beforehand.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「I'm sorry. I didn't wear my diapers to bed.」
		PRINTFORML 「I thought my messing issues were only during the day.」
	ENDIF
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼非受託時"
	PRINTDATAL
		DATAFORM 「Don't leave me clueless! I'm dying of embarrassment right now!」
	ENDDATA
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼受託時"
	PRINTFORMW 「Come to my room.」
	PRINTFORMDW As you enter the room, you begin to smell the familiar odor of a poopy accident.
	PRINTFORMDW A large brown patch stains the blue sheets of the bed, and a pair of soiled pajamas sits on the floor.
	CALL PRINT_STRW, @"「If @ITALIC@anyone@ were to find out that I mess the bed, my legitimacy is going to go down the gutter..」"
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼確認時"
	PRINTFORML 「Figure out what has happened to my body, please!」
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼破棄時"
	PRINTFORML 「Don't leave me clueless! I'm dying of embarrassment right now!」
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼実行直前"
	
	RETURN 0
CASE "依頼実行直後"
	
	RETURN 0
CASE "成功報告時"
;報酬：
	PRINTFORMDW You pick up the soiled panties and store them in your pocket.
	PRINTFORML 「Just take them. I'm sure Diaper-sama is going to find a use for them.」
	PRINTFORML 「In fact, take the pajamas too.」
	PRINTFORMDL You move the pajamas into a safe place too.
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORMDL You walk towards the bed to access the damage.
	PRINTFORMDL The soiling seems to be caked brown, while semi-liquidly too. The smell is even more pungent here.
	PRINTFORMDL Even if the sheets were to be washed, some part of %CALLNAME:60%'s accident will still stick.
	PRINTFORMDL You lift up the soiled sheets in each of the bed's corners, trying to see if the mattress is still fine.
	PRINTL
	;You take off the soiled sheets.
	PRINTFORMDW Oh dear, the bed's ruined.
	PRINTFORMDW The staining has fouled the mattress and it ain't coming off at all.
	PRINTFORMDW It'll smell like someone had an accident even with the best cleaning.
	PRINTFORML 「God help me.」
	PRINTFORML 「This... this is much worse than I thought. Is there like, any way to save my bed?」
	PRINTFORML 「I just want this nightmare to be all over...」
	PRINTFORMDL %CALLNAME:60% moves towards a wall, looking down.
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORML 「I just bought a pack of Wanwanman bed pads from the store to deal with this.」
	PRINTFORML 「Rip one out and blot it against the stain. Hopefully it goes away?」
	PRINTFORMDL You open the pack of 「Unimu Wanwanman」 pads next to the bed and rip one out.
	PRINTFORMDL Opening the pad and placing the pad on the absorbent side, you start to blout of the liquid mess seeping in the bed.
	PRINTFORMDL It takes quite a bit of time, but the most of the mess comes out.
	PRINTFORMDL The faint smell and the stain on the mattress are the only reminders left that indicate this accident happened.
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORML 「I don't want this to happen again.」
	PRINTFORML 「Do you have any kind of advice to prevent this?」
	{
		CALL ASK_M(
			@"Tell %CALLNAME:60% to diaper up and mess in her sleep", 1,
			@"Give the Potty Training Guide", ITEM:113,
			"Cancel", 1,
		)
	}
	TFLAG:144 = RESULT
	SELECTCASE TFLAG:144
	CASE 0
		PRINTFORMDW You tell %CALLNAME:60% to not worry about it.
		PRINTFORMDW Just diaper up, poop in her sleep and keep sleeping.
		PRINTFORMDW Keeping her dry is important too, so you also tell %CALLNAME:60% to prioritize protection.
		PRINTFORMDW Thick diapers with covers, bedwetting pads, plastic sheets.
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORML 「Well.... wearing diapers to bed isn't as embarrassing as wearing them in the daytime.」
		PRINTFORML 「And I'll make sure to use those Wanwanmans in case they do leak.」
		PRINTFORML 「Oh. Oh... What about when %K60_NAME_WITH_HONORIFICS("Yuugi")% comes over.」
		PRINTFORML 「She's going to figure out the nighttime padding really quick.」
		PRINTL
